"Argold is the System currency, held in an account."
"Ten Argold is about 40 Canadian dollars; 50,000 is a little over $150,000."
"Standard post on Anesidora costs half an Argold."
"Argold can be put under a visitor's name and loaded onto a NesiCard."
"Artonans pay Rabbits in Argold for their services."
